'''Lunar Seiko Collection''' (「お月見にゃんこコレクションガチャ」) is one of the Rare Cat Capsule events in [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou]]. This event was to celebrate the release of [[Mighty Rekon Korps (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Rekon Korps]] being added as an obtainable unit. It features select Ubers from varying banners as well as the addition of two VIP Uber Rares, [[Mimiluga (PC Uber Rare Cat)|Mimiluga]] and [[Wise Empress Nobel (PC Uber Rare Cat)|Wise Empress Nobel]]. It only had one run, starting from September 24, 2018 until October 2, 2018.

